# AF632: Dragonologist's ability chip, and later Betor, Kin to All's, drew without art — neither is
# in any cube, so `art-artists.json` (the committed, cube-and-library-pool artist table) never heard
# of either, even though `play/art-ids.ts` resolves their id fine. Alice casts Dragonologist (its
# "enters, look at the top six" trigger goes on the stack) while bob (Full Control) holds priority, so
# the trigger stays there as the chip, same mechanism as `w67-trigger.state`. Betor, Kin to All sits
# on alice's battlefield already, with Wall of Omens beside it (total toughness 11, clearing Betor's
# own "if creatures you control have total toughness 10 or greater" check), so once Dragonologist's
# trigger is done and the turn is walked forward to alice's end step, Betor's own trigger goes on the
# stack the same way.
